            "title": "Object-Oriented Analysis & Design",
            "content": "<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-blue-400\">Object-Oriented Analysis &amp; Design</h3>\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500\">CS-305 &bull; Unit 5: Object-Oriented Design &amp; UML</p>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\">OOAD identifies objects and their responsibilities from requirements.</p>\n\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6\">\n    <div class=\"bg-gray-800/90 p-5 rounded-xl border-t-4 border-blue-500 shadow-lg\">\n        <h4 class=\"text-blue-300 font-bold mb-3 text-lg\">Core Concepts</h4>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm\">\n            <li><strong>OOA:</strong> analysis modelling the problem domain as objects</li>\n            <li><strong>OOD:</strong> design defining classes, interfaces and collaborations</li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bg-gray-800/90 p-5 rounded-xl border-t-4 border-emerald-500 shadow-lg\">\n        <h4 class=\"text-emerald-300 font-bold mb-3 text-lg\">Key Points &amp; Exam Focus</h4>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm\">\n            <li><strong>Cohesion and Coupling:</strong> good design has high cohesion and low coupling</li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-blue-400\">Concept Map</h3>\n<div class=\"mermaid bg-gray-900 p-6 rounded-lg mb-6 flex justify-center border border-gray-700 shadow-inner\">\ngraph LR\n    T[Object-Oriented Analysis and Design]\n    T --> N0[OOA]\n    T --> N1[OOD]\n    T --> N2[Cohesion and Coupling]\n    T -.-> X[Next: UML Class and Object Diagrams]\n    style T fill:#1e293b,stroke:#3b82f6,color:#fff\n    style N0 fill:#1e293b,stroke:#10b981,color:#fff\n    style N1 fill:#1e293b,stroke:#f59e0b,color:#fff\n    style N2 fill:#1e293b,stroke:#8b5cf6,color:#fff\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-blue-400\">Quick Revision Table</h3>\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto mb-6\">\n    <table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-t border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-cyan-300 align-top\">OOA</td><td class=\"py-2 text-slate-300\">analysis modelling the problem domain as objects</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-t border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-cyan-300 align-top\">OOD</td><td class=\"py-2 text-slate-300\">design defining classes, interfaces and collaborations</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-t border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-cyan-300 align-top\">Cohesion and Coupling</td><td class=\"py-2 text-slate-300\">good design has high cohesion and low coupling</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-blue-400\">In-depth Explanation</h3>\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl p-5 mb-6 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed space-y-3\">\n    <p>OOAD identifies objects and their responsibilities from requirements. Start with <strong>OOA</strong>, which is analysis modelling the problem domain as objects. Next comes <strong>OOD</strong>, which is design defining classes, interfaces and collaborations. Finally, there is <strong>Cohesion and Coupling</strong>, which is good design has high cohesion and low coupling.</p>\n    <p>Together, <em>OOA</em>, <em>OOD</em> and <em>Cohesion and Coupling</em> form the vocabulary examiners expect when they ask about <strong>Object-Oriented Analysis &amp; Design</strong>. Write each definition precisely, add a labelled diagram or formula where one exists, and close with an application or example.</p>\n    <p><strong>Links within Unit 5:</strong> this topic is usually read together with UML Class &amp; Object Diagrams, UML Behavioural Diagrams and Design Patterns Overview; long answers on <em>Object-Oriented Design &amp; UML</em> often combine them.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-amber-500/30 rounded-xl p-5 mb-6 text-sm text-amber-200/90\">\n    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-amber-300 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\">\n        <span>&#128221;</span> RGPV Exam Blueprint\n    </h4>\n    <ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 leading-relaxed\">\n            <li>Define <em>OOA</em> and state where it is used. <span class=\"text-slate-500\">(2-3 marks)</span></li>\n            <li>Define <em>OOD</em> and state where it is used. <span class=\"text-slate-500\">(2-3 marks)</span></li>\n            <li>Define <em>Cohesion and Coupling</em> and state where it is used. <span class=\"text-slate-500\">(2-3 marks)</span></li>\n            <li>Differentiate between <em>OOA</em> and <em>OOD</em> (any four points). <span class=\"text-slate-500\">(4 marks)</span></li>\n            <li>Explain <em>Object-Oriented Analysis &amp; Design</em> with a neat labelled diagram, covering OOA, OOD, Cohesion and Coupling. <span class=\"text-slate-500\">(7 marks)</span></li>\n    </ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6\">\n    <div class=\"bg-gray-800/90 p-5 rounded-xl border-t-4 border-red-500 shadow-lg\">\n        <h4 class=\"text-red-300 font-bold mb-3 text-lg\">&#127909; Video Lectures</h4>\n        <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm\">\n            <li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Object-Oriented%20Analysis%20%26%20Design%20Object%20Oriented%20Programming%20%26%20Methodology\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"text-red-300 hover:text-red-200 underline decoration-red-500/40\">&#9654; Object-Oriented Analysis & Design &mdash; full lecture</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Object-Oriented%20Analysis%20%26%20Design%20NPTEL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"text-red-300 hover:text-red-200 underline decoration-red-500/40\">&#9654; Object-Oriented Analysis & Design &mdash; NPTEL / IIT lectures</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Object-Oriented%20Analysis%20%26%20Design%20RGPV%20CS-305%20important%20questions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"text-red-300 hover:text-red-200 underline decoration-red-500/40\">&#9654; CS-305 &mdash; RGPV exam-oriented explanation</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Object%20Oriented%20Programming%20%26%20Methodology%20unit%205%20Object-Oriented%20Design%20%26%20UML\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"text-red-300 hover:text-red-200 underline decoration-red-500/40\">&#9654; Unit 5 complete playlist: Object-Oriented Design &amp; UML</a></li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bg-gray-800/90 p-5 rounded-xl border-t-4 border-cyan-500 shadow-lg\">\n        <h4 class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold mb-3 text-lg\">&#128218; Study Material &amp; References</h4>\n        <ul class=\"space-y-1.5 text-sm text-gray-300\">\n            <li><a href=\"assets/resources/cs305/notes/cs305-unit-wise-study-notes.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" download class=\"text-cyan-300 underline\">&#11015; CS-305 unit-wise study notes (PDF)</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"assets/resources/cs305/mock-papers/cs305-rgpv-model-question-paper.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" download class=\"text-cyan-300 underline\">&#11015; CS-305 RGPV model question paper (PDF)</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"https://www.rgpv.ac.in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"text-cyan-300 underline\">Official RGPV scheme &amp; syllabus portal</a></li>\n        </ul>\n        <p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 mt-3 mb-1\">Standard textbooks</p>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-xs text-gray-400\">\n            <li><em>Object-Oriented Programming in C++</em> &mdash; Robert Lafore</li>\n            <li><em>The C++ Programming Language</em> &mdash; Bjarne Stroustrup</li>\n            <li><em>Object-Oriented Analysis and Design with Applications</em> &mdash; Grady Booch</li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n</div>",
